1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,220
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,816
You little wretch.

3
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:40,100
In such a hurry to see me?

4
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,380
I never expected

5
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,976
you'd still be alive.

6
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,420
What?

7
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,256
Come for revenge?

8
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,300
Revenge is only the beginning.

9
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,576
Do you remember what
you did to A-Xiang and me?

10
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,696
A-Xiang?

11
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,936
I'll repay you a thousandfold.

12
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,700
What I did to A-Xiang...

13
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,340
You know that better than anyone.

14
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:09,096
That insignificant little bastard back then

15
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:12,140
has grown even prettier than A-Xiang.

16
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:15,020
-Come here.
-How dare you!

17
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:30,576
You used to kneel and beg for mercy.

18
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,420
Now you've learned to throw
your authority around.

19
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,780
Didn't you come for revenge?

20
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,140
The knife is right there.

21
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:41,460
What?

22
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,500
Too afraid to take it?

23
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,976
Of course.

24
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,820
That night, ten years ago,

25
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,256
you also tried to kill me with a knife.

26
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:00,376
Too bad I've lived another ten years.

27
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,020
Your little friend wasn't so lucky.

28
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,096
By now,

29
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:08,936
she's a lonely ghost in an unmarked grave.

30
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,660
What a pity when I think about it.

31
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,056
The more she begged,

32
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,336
the more excited I became.

33
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,420
Let go of me! Let go!

34
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,620
Let go of me!

35
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,860
-Let go of me!
-Do it!

36
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:26,176
I'm a law-abiding citizen now, Lao Zhai.

37
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,576
And you're an imperial official.

38
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,420
You can't kill me.

39
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,256
Ten years have passed.

40
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,936
I'm no longer the beggar
you could abuse at will.

41
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,696
What you owe those children

42
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:47,140
must now be repaid.

43
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:59,056
These are white plum blossoms
from Mount Zhongnan.

44
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,216
Placed in a music house,

45
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,260
they symbolize pure
notes and refined charm.

46
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,260
Careful. You'll cut your hand.

47
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,420
I'm truly sorry.

48
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:19,776
I'll compensate the proprietor
at three times the market price.

49
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,456
It was only an ordinary ornament.

50
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,936
No need to be so courteous,
Young Master He.

51
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,616
But you, Young Master He,

52
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:27,376
have been visiting Huiyin House
quite often lately.

53
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:30,736
I wonder whether you're
interested in music and dance,

54
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,696
or in me.

55
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,100
Interested in me?

56
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,736
Naturally, I'm interested in you.

57
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:39,776
I've always found you
rather mysterious, Miss Situ.

58
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,416
You don't seem to be merely

59
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:42,416
the proprietor of a music house.

60
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,056
The feeling is mutual.

61
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:46,216
I've entertained many
sons of noble families

62
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,616
and consider myself a
good judge of character.

63
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:50,936
Yet your bearing is
exceptionally distinguished,

64
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,136
and your knowledge extraordinary.

65
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,536
You hardly seem,
as Young Master Shen claimed,

66
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,180
to be an ordinary merchant.

67
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,256
Wait.

68
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:00,656
I clearly knew Proprietor Situ first,

69
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,896
yet now I can't get a word in.

70
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,296
You two are getting along so well

71
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,296
that you seem more like kindred spirits.

72
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,296
Then I hope Miss Situ and I

73
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,780
will not suddenly go

74
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,016
from kindred spirits to strangers.

75
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:12,980
I might become a stranger to anyone,

76
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,100
but with you, Young Master He...

77
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,780
I'd be reluctant to.

78
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:21,176
Has His Majesty dismissed his suspicions

79
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,456
and started calling her a kindred spirit?

80
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:25,096
She's the most renowned
music-house proprietor in the capital,

81
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,096
smooth and flawless in every situation.

82
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,816
You actually believe what she says?

83
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,220
Then why did Your Majesty...?

84
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,216
I was merely playing along.

85
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,416
She has no sword wound on her body.

86
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:34,496
Yet Your Majesty still suspects her?

87
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,936
After testing her today,

88
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,136
I am even more certain

89
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,816
that her identity is anything but ordinary.

90
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,060
Zhishu,

91
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,456
follow the musicians'
convoy to the frontier.

92
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,856
Whatever they purchase,

93
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,496
investigate every detail thoroughly.

94
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,940
I obey.

95
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:52,336
Help!

96
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:55,936
Meng Tinghui of the Bureau of
Intelligence has killed someone!

97
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,056
Someone report this to the authorities!

98
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,296
Help!

99
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:01,416
Murder!

100
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:05,700
Lord Meng Tinghui of the
Bureau of Intelligence

101
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,016
is taking a life in broad daylight!

102
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,540
She treats human life as worthless!

103
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,260
Please, everyone,

104
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,540
save this old man!

105
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,700
Lord Meng!

106
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:38,540
Spare me, Lord Meng! Please!

107
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,776
I'm only a commoner.

108
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:46,176
I've never done anything wicked in my life!

109
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,256
Lord Meng,

110
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,496
I only know that back in Shazhou,

111
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,816
you were a swindler and thief,

112
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,896
a petty thug with blood on your hands.

113
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,696
But don't worry, Lord Meng.

114
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:57,336
Spare my life,

115
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,616
and I would never dare mention

116
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:01,656
your dark past to anyone.

117
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,456
That woman is Lord Meng
of the Bureau of Intelligence.

118
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,696
That's right.

119
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,896
She's actually abusing

120
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,136
-a crippled old man while wearing official robes.
-Please spare me!

121
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:10,216
-Spare me! Please spare me!
-How did this old man offend her?

122
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,540
Stop pretending.

123
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,740
Do you think this will help you escape?

124
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,900
You little wretch.

125
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:23,296
If you've got the nerve, kill me

126
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,860
in front of everyone.

127
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,540
I'm a law-abiding citizen now.

128
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,140
Come on, then...

129
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,100
Do it!

130
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:47,340
This... Lord Meng, she...

131
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:50,980
Back then,

132
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:54,100
that persecuted little beggar

133
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,536
truly could do nothing to you.

134
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,576
I swore that if I ever held
a blade in my hand,

135
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,416
I would cut you into a thousand pieces.

136
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,780
You?

137
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:06,340
A mere beggar making empty threats?

138
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,300
But today,

139
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:11,740
I wear the robes of an imperial official

140
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,340
and stand beneath the law of the realm.

141
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,580
With this office and this life,

142
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,376
I will personally bring you to justice.

143
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:22,300
You dare?

144
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,900
I'll kill you!

145
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:38,220
Today is the day you die!

146
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:45,100
Let go of me!

147
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,220
I'm going to kill you!

148
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,700
Save me!

149
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,660
Save...

150
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,380
Meng Tinghui!

151
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:28,936
Number eighty-eight!

152
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,100
-Over here!
-Welcome, honored guests. Please come inside.

153
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,856
Please don't be impatient, everyone.

154
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,496
We'll get to you very soon.

155
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:37,536
Everyone, Bofeng House is full today.

156
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:39,736
It will take another incense
stick before a table opens up.

157
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,136
Guests whose numbers haven't been called

158
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,536
may have a cup of ginger tea first.

159
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,900
The wind is cold.
Take care not to catch a chill.

160
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,176
What a ridiculous show.

161
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,016
You're only acting smug
because you have court backing.

162
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:51,256
Let's see how much longer

163
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,336
you can keep hopping around
like a grasshopper in autumn.

164
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,296
You couldn't hop even if you tried.

165
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,176
May Bofeng House run into trouble soon.

166
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,380
Shopkeeper!

167
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,376
Shopkeeper!

168
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,216
Shopkeeper, I saw Lord Meng...

169
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,540
-What happened to Mengmeng?
-Lord Meng killed someone!

170
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:10,176
-Watch the shop.
-So she finally killed someone.

171
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,300
I told you she wouldn't last much longer.

172
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,060
Miss Yan.

173
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,100
Young Lord Shen.

174
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,936
Where are you going, Miss Yan?

175
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,216
I'm going to the Bureau of Intelligence.

176
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,456
They said Mengmeng killed someone.

177
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,736
His Majesty witnessed it himself.

178
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,816
Lord Meng has already
been taken into the palace.

179
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:43,216
Mengmeng would never
kill an innocent person.

180
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,176
She must have had a reason.

181
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,980
Then I'll go to the palace to find her.

182
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,336
Without His Majesty's summons,

183
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,456
no one can enter.

184
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,576
Then I won't go in.

185
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,660
I'll wait for her at the palace gate.

186
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,376
-I'll take you.
-Young Lord Shen,

187
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,016
we still have important business.
We cannot delay.

188
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,856
You go ahead.
My horse is fast. I'll catch up later.

189
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,776
Young Lord Shen,
the snow is falling hard and fast.

190
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,216
It is far too dangerous

191
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,936
for you to ride alone.

192
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,780
Forget it. I'll find another way.

193
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,376
Do as I say.

194
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,540
Yes.

195
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,900
Mount up.

196
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,216
Your Majesty.

197
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,536
The Ministry of Revenue has confirmed

198
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,896
that the man's name is Lao Zhai.

199
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:45,176
He is nearly fifty and has a lame leg.

200
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,216
Though his family is poor,

201
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,776
he has never broken the law.

202
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,176
Meng Tinghui killed an innocent man.

203
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,536
Her crime merits death.

204
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:54,300
Everyone I killed deserved to die.

205
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,736
Lao Zhai was no law-abiding citizen.

206
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:58,056
He was a human trafficker
with countless crimes.

207
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:58,976
Master Wen.

208
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,736
Utter nonsense, Your Majesty.

209
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:03,096
Lao Zhai's household registration
and his neighbors' testimony

210
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,776
are enough to prove his innocence.

211
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:06,260
If he was innocent,

212
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,980
then no one in this world is innocent.

213
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,700
-Summon Lao Zhai.
-Bring Lao Zhai in.

214
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,256
This commoner, Lao Zhai,

215
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,016
greets Your Majesty.

216
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,620
Raise your head.

217
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,176
What grievance exists

218
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,740
between you and Meng Tinghui?

219
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,256
Tell the truth.

220
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,740
Your Majesty,

221
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,736
this humble man is originally from Shazhou.

222
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:53,936
Because Lord Meng and
I are from the same place,

223
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:56,576
I know she once lived
on the streets of Shazhou

224
00:12:56,600 --> 00:13:00,536
as a thieving, deceitful
beggar who committed every evil.

225
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,896
She once poisoned someone

226
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:04,780
just to steal half a string of coins.

227
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:07,576
She often gathered other young beggars

228
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,660
to prey on passing merchants.

229
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,380
Lord Meng,

230
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:15,296
it has been ten years.

231
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,816
Had you not rushed out to kill me,

232
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,856
I never would have recognized you as

233
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:22,940
the little beggar who once stole my silver.

234
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,176
Do you think changing your name

235
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,980
can erase your sins?

236
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,896
Ten years ago,

237
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:35,176
you made your living trafficking children.

238
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:37,696
You forced them to steal
and beg for your profit.

239
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,896
If they resisted,
you broke their hands and feet.

240
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:41,656
You raped young girls.

241
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,056
Then sold them into slavery.

242
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,976
My elder sister, A-Xiang,

243
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,540
died at your hands.

244
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:51,456
Changing your name means nothing.

245
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:54,060
Even if you were reduced to ashes,

246
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,620
I...

247
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:00,380
would still recognize you.

248
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:04,776
Lord Meng,

249
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,056
do you have evidence?

250
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,336
Does wearing those official robes

251
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,216
give you the right to accuse someone

252
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,740
with nothing but your own words?

253
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,460
I know

254
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:17,700
I'm only a humble commoner.

255
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,016
My words carry little weight.

256
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:23,900
I am certainly not some Master Wen.

257
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:28,780
I beg Your Majesty to investigate clearly.

258
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,580
I am the evidence.

259
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:35,256
I was one of the children
you trafficked back then.

260
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,180
That leg of yours

261
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,300
was crippled by me.

262
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:43,936
How dare you, Meng Tinghui!

263
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,496
You oppress a commoner
in the imperial court.

264
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,376
What regard have you for
His Majesty and the assembled officials?

265
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:48,820
Murder!

266
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,380
Lord Meng!

267
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:59,060
Your Majesty,

268
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,296
her claims grow more absurd by the moment.

269
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,296
This humble man's leg

270
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,096
was injured in an accident

271
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,416
while unloading goods in Shazhou.

272
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:11,980
That is why I came to the capital
to make a living, Your Majesty.

273
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,696
Lord Meng,

274
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,136
how can you frame me so casually?

275
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:17,136
You human trafficker!

276
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:19,696
You distort the truth
and accuse me instead.

277
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,176
I regret not stabbing
you to death back then.

278
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,540
Meng Tinghui,

279
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:28,020
do you have any witness
or physical evidence

280
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:31,300
proving he is the trafficker
you call Master Wen?

281
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,180
I...

282
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,460
do not.

283
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,016
Your Majesty,

284
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,616
I stake my life on this.

285
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:45,976
Every word I said is true.

286
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,340
He deliberately appeared
to lure me into a trap.

287
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:50,820
I beg Your Majesty to
investigate thoroughly.

288
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,296
Your Majesty,

289
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:55,340
why would an old cripple like me

290
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:57,940
put on such an elaborate act

291
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:01,176
just to frame her?

292
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,896
People often say

293
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,176
officials protect one another.

294
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,980
If you intend to shield her,

295
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:10,380
what can a mere commoner like me

296
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:13,860
possibly do against you?

297
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,700
Your Majesty,

298
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:18,096
since Meng Tinghui cannot produce evidence,

299
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,736
I respectfully request that Your Majesty

300
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,616
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence,

301
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,216
immediately imprison Meng Tinghui,

302
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:27,220
strip her of office, and investigate
her to uphold court discipline.

303
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,416
Your Majesty,

304
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,820
I know Your Majesty values
and cherishes talent.

305
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,976
However, Meng Tinghui's actions this time

306
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,416
have violated the law and
caused grave consequences.

307
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,856
If this matter is mishandled

308
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,976
and word spreads that
the court shields officials

309
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,496
who kill innocent commoners,

310
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,216
the court's authority may be damaged

311
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:45,180
and the foundations of the realm shaken.

312
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,100
I also respectfully
request that Your Majesty

313
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:49,416
act according to the law,

314
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:51,016
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence,

315
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,456
severely punish Meng Tinghui,

316
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,620
and reassure the realm.

317
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,496
I second the motion.

318
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,496
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

319
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,700
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

320
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,500
Raise your head and look.

321
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,980
Do you recognize this dagger?

322
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:39,656
This humble man does not.

323
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,856
Then I shall help you remember.

324
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,620
Left Chancellor, do you recall

325
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,616
where I was ten years ago?

326
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,140
Your Majesty,

327
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:49,976
ten years ago, Your Majesty was fourteen

328
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,096
and first toured the realm
on behalf of the late emperor.

329
00:17:53,120 --> 00:17:54,496
You personally went to the
frontier prefecture of Shazhou

330
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:57,380
and destroyed a local
human-trafficking ring.

331
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,660
The young man who saved me back then

332
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:17,816
was actually you?

333
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:18,896
Could Your Majesty be...?

334
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,580
That's right.

335
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,620
It was I.

336
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:41,536
Meng Tinghui used this very dagger

337
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,300
to wound your leg.

338
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:00,336
I witnessed everything
you did with my own eyes.

339
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,900
Are you saying...

340
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:03,580
that I am falsely accusing you?

341
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,456
You wanted evidence, did you not?

342
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:09,136
Meng Tinghui has none, but I do.

343
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,696
I am the witness.

344
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,096
And this dagger

345
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:13,660
is the physical evidence.

346
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,656
Its triangular blade

347
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,896
is unique.

348
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,656
It matches the wound on your body.

349
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:21,540
Must I personally examine
your injury to prove it?

350
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:24,736
If Your Majesty closes the case so hastily

351
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,336
and shows favoritism toward Meng Tinghui,

352
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:28,096
the people will say

353
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:29,696
that any official who
wins Your Majesty's favor

354
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:32,216
may kill at will.

355
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:33,380
Such a decision

356
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,856
will chill the hearts of all commoners.

357
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:37,660
Di Nian.

358
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:41,020
Bring in the witness.

359
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:56,856
The condemned slave, Heiying,

360
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:58,100
pays his respects to Your Majesty.

361
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,056
Ten years ago,

362
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:05,260
I helped Master Wen escape from Shazhou.

363
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:08,856
At the time, he trafficked children,

364
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:10,376
forcing them to steal.

365
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,936
Those who refused were tortured,
killed, and buried.

366
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:15,056
This condemned slave was
once Master Wen's trusted subordinate.

367
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:17,180
I abducted thirty-nine children for him.

368
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:19,456
Lord Meng and her sworn sister

369
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:21,456
attempted to escape many times.

370
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:22,936
I was always ordered to bring them back.

371
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,496
I personally saw Master Wen in Shazhou

372
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:26,576
forge the identity of
a law-abiding citizen.

373
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,656
Now he has changed his name again

374
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:29,336
and hidden in the capital.

375
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:31,136
We have had no contact for ten years.

376
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,416
Master Wen still bears
an arrow wound on his chest,

377
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:36,056
inflicted when Your Majesty toured Shazhou.

378
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:38,820
This man is unquestionably Master Wen.

379
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,136
You hid under a false
identity in the capital for years,

380
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,456
then suddenly appeared
to provoke her into violence.

381
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:49,500
None of this can be a coincidence.

382
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,860
Speak.

383
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:55,536
Who ordered you

384
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:57,460
to frame Meng Tinghui?

385
00:20:57,840 --> 00:20:59,776
Spare me, Your Majesty!

386
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,616
Please spare me!

387
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,376
I hated Meng Tinghui

388
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,016
for crippling me back then.

389
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:07,336
That is why I agreed to help
the leader of the Tiger Roar Gang

390
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:09,380
get rid of her.

391
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,780
The Tiger Roar Gang.

392
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,860
My ministers,

393
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:20,976
the Tiger Roar Gang plotted to
frame an imperial official.

394
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,700
The truth has now been revealed.

395
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:24,536
Do you still demand that I
abolish the Bureau of Intelligence

396
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:26,220
and severely punish Meng Tinghui?

397
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,740
Study.

398
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:37,416
Pass the imperial examination.

399
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:39,336
Enter the court as an official.

400
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:41,696
How can I become as powerful as you?

401
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:44,576
Study, pass the imperial examination,

402
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,820
and enter the court as an official.

403
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:48,540
Once authority is in your hands,

404
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,740
everything will be different.

405
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:53,020
You truly accomplished it all.

406
00:21:55,400 --> 00:21:57,616
Step by step,

407
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:59,300
you truly made your way before me.

408
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:40,736
As an imperial official, Meng Tinghui

409
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:43,216
should be severely punished
for privately assaulting someone.

410
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:46,216
However, considering the cruel
abuse you suffered at his hands

411
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:48,500
and the misery of your circumstances,
your actions are understandable.

412
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:50,336
You are therefore fined
three months' salary.

413
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:52,500
Take this as a lesson in the future.

414
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:55,060
Do not let hatred blind you.

415
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:00,660
Thank you for Your Majesty's mercy.

416
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:04,060
I will remember your instruction

417
00:23:05,040 --> 00:23:06,340
and never betray Your Majesty's grace.

418
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:10,016
You trafficked children,
murdered innocents,

419
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:12,056
and framed an imperial official.

420
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:14,256
Under the Great Ning Code,
your crimes shall be punished together.

421
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:15,860
You are sentenced to death by beheading.

422
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,216
Spare me, Your Majesty!

423
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,536
Lord Meng!

424
00:23:22,560 --> 00:23:24,096
Please spare me!

425
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:25,336
Your Majesty,

426
00:23:25,360 --> 00:23:28,176
even if these men's crimes are unforgivable

427
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:30,136
and the Tiger Roar Gang deserves execution,

428
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,496
Your Majesty has still

429
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:33,256
placed the Bureau of
Intelligence in the hands

430
00:23:33,280 --> 00:23:35,016
of a deceitful beggar
with a disgraceful past.

431
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:36,256
How can the people accept her authority?

432
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,856
This will never command respect.

433
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:38,776
Left Chancellor,

434
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:41,376
can a beggar not study
and enter official service?

435
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,576
Everything I did in the past

436
00:23:42,600 --> 00:23:44,936
was forced upon me by Master Wen.

437
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:46,736
I studied diligently and earned
distinction in the examinations,

438
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:48,696
advancing step by step
to where I stand today.

439
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:50,380
If I am unqualified,

440
00:23:51,520 --> 00:23:53,936
is Ding Chong, who treated
human life as worthless, qualified?

441
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:56,376
Is Wan Kai, who sheltered
the Tiger Roar Gang, qualified?

442
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,496
Or in the gambling-house case,

443
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:59,576
were Vice Minister Zheng
and the others who were arrested

444
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:01,096
qualified?

445
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:02,736
I nearly forgot.

446
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:05,176
They were all your prized disciples,
Left Chancellor.

447
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:08,016
-How dare you!
-As imperial officials,

448
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:09,816
you failed to judge men properly

449
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,860
and nearly became the
Tiger Roar Gang's claws and fangs.

450
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:14,096
After this matter,

451
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:16,620
all of you should return
home and reflect carefully

452
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:19,100
on what it truly means
to serve as a minister.

453
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,340
What are we going to do?

454
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:26,216
They've been questioning her all night,

455
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,820
and she still hasn't been released.

456
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:31,656
None of you know what
Master Wen did to her.

457
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:34,340
That beast deserved to be
cut into a thousand pieces long ago.

458
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:35,736
This is all my fault.

459
00:24:35,760 --> 00:24:37,816
Mengmeng worked so
hard to become an official.

460
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:40,096
I should have noticed sooner
that something was troubling her

461
00:24:40,120 --> 00:24:41,776
and killed Master Wen for her.

462
00:24:41,800 --> 00:24:42,940
I...

463
00:24:47,120 --> 00:24:49,700
Don't panic. Let's wait a little longer.

464
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,900
Where is she?

465
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:05,776
Could His Majesty have thrown
Mengmeng into the imperial prison?

466
00:25:05,800 --> 00:25:07,056
Wait here and try not to worry.

467
00:25:07,080 --> 00:25:08,420
I'll find out what's happening.

468
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,140
Mengmeng!

469
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:16,580
Mengmeng!

470
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:19,016
Thank heavens, you're finally out.

471
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:20,416
What happened?

472
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,820
Are you hurt?

473
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:23,656
How did His Majesty rule

474
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:24,976
on Master Wen's case?

475
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,540
And did His Majesty punish you?

476
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,380
Fu Zhi,

477
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:36,380
I finally avenged Sister A-Xiang.

478
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:40,540
Back then,

479
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:43,180
I failed to kill him with my own hands.

480
00:25:46,080 --> 00:25:48,460
Now His Majesty has permitted
me to supervise his execution.

481
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,180
I finally...

482
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,660
finally...

483
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:16,900
It's all over.

484
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,220
Your nightmare is over too.

485
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:21,660
From now on, I'll be by your side.

486
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,456
Lord Meng,

487
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:25,256
avenging such a deep wrong is a good thing.

488
00:26:25,280 --> 00:26:27,740
But did His Majesty become
angry with you over this?

489
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,620
That's right.

490
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:32,820
Do you remember the young man

491
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:35,820
I told you saved me ten years ago?

492
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:38,456
Of course.

493
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,616
You even drew many portraits of him.

494
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:42,296
He turned out to be His Majesty.

495
00:26:42,320 --> 00:26:44,020
His Majesty?

496
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:47,140
All of this

497
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:51,096
feels like a dream.

498
00:26:51,120 --> 00:26:53,096
I never imagined

499
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:55,416
that over these ten years,

500
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:57,536
His Majesty would become
even more handsome.

501
00:26:57,560 --> 00:26:59,736
You still have time to swoon over him?

502
00:26:59,760 --> 00:27:00,980
Then you must be fine.

503
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,216
Young Lord Shen,

504
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,136
why are you here?

505
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:06,056
She insisted on rushing
over to find you yesterday.

506
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:07,256
I feared her recklessness
would cause trouble,

507
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,376
so I came with her.

508
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:09,736
But now that I've seen you safe and sound,

509
00:27:09,760 --> 00:27:11,420
I can set out with peace of mind.

510
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:19,096
Thank you, Young Lord Shen.
But rest assured,

511
00:27:19,120 --> 00:27:21,496
I will never fall for you

512
00:27:21,520 --> 00:27:24,100
-just because you eagerly helped me.
-You'd better not.

513
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,500
Yan Fuzhi,

514
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:37,020
go home.

515
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:59,216
It is three quarters past noon.

516
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,336
Carry out the execution.

517
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:03,020
Behead him.

518
00:28:29,040 --> 00:28:30,180
Sister Tinghui.

519
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:39,060
Sister A-Xiang.

520
00:28:46,280 --> 00:28:47,820
My dear Sister Tinghui,

521
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:50,816
I saw everything you did for me.

522
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:52,060
You've suffered so much.

523
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,576
Sister A-Xiang,

524
00:28:57,600 --> 00:29:00,740
in the end, I still couldn't save you.

525
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,420
I'm sorry.

526
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:05,416
I never regretted

527
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:07,180
saving you that day.

528
00:29:07,760 --> 00:29:09,056
Now,

529
00:29:09,080 --> 00:29:10,620
seeing the person you've become

530
00:29:11,600 --> 00:29:13,140
brings me even greater comfort.

531
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,536
Let go

532
00:29:28,560 --> 00:29:29,940
of the knot in your heart.

533
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:31,696
From now on,

534
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:34,060
you must see all the beautiful
sights in this world

535
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,740
on my behalf.

536
00:30:27,800 --> 00:30:29,500
Sister A-Xiang.

537
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:38,260
Sister A-Xiang!

538
00:31:34,800 --> 00:31:36,216
I heard

539
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:39,260
one was a young emperor
traveling incognito,

540
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:42,736
while the other was a lonely
orphan surviving in the streets.

541
00:31:42,760 --> 00:31:45,536
Heaven tied a red thread between them

542
00:31:45,560 --> 00:31:47,456
and brought together two people

543
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:48,536
as different as clouds and mud.

544
00:31:48,560 --> 00:31:49,896
Tell me,

545
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,776
isn't that more exciting than a storybook?

546
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:52,896
It certainly is.

547
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:54,336
Fate truly is

548
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,460
impossible to explain.

549
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:59,140
I would love to see her beauty for myself.

550
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:01,256
Unfortunately, Bofeng House

551
00:32:01,280 --> 00:32:02,176
-won't open its doors.
-Here.

552
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:04,296
-I came early this morning.
-Make way, please.

553
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:05,976
-Here, Shopkeeper.
-There are many things in this world

554
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,456
that are impossible to explain.

555
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:09,256
Far too many.

556
00:32:09,280 --> 00:32:10,616
Some people

557
00:32:10,640 --> 00:32:11,936
have no respect for the law.

558
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:13,976
She actually dared kill
someone in the street.

559
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:15,856
Tell me, how is that any different

560
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:17,576
from a common butcher?

561
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:20,056
She's merely relying on imperial favor.

562
00:32:20,080 --> 00:32:22,540
What genuine ability does she have?

563
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:25,336
Shopkeeper, when those noble ladies

564
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:26,936
came to Spring House for tea the other day,

565
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:29,056
didn't you have a delightful
conversation with them?

566
00:32:29,080 --> 00:32:31,176
You must know the inside story, don't you?

567
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,536
-Inside story?
-There's more to it?

568
00:32:32,560 --> 00:32:34,136
Shopkeeper Yu, tell us.

569
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:36,816
Those noble young ladies are all saying

570
00:32:36,840 --> 00:32:39,096
that Meng Tinghui is Daji reincarnated.

571
00:32:39,120 --> 00:32:40,296
-Daji?
-Daji reincarnated?

572
00:32:40,320 --> 00:32:42,940
She has bewitched the emperor.

573
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:45,696
-Shopkeeper, are you all right?
-Yan Fuzhi!

574
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:47,340
How dare you splash water on me?

575
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:51,736
Listen carefully. Say one more
bad word about Mengmeng,

576
00:32:51,760 --> 00:32:53,696
and I'll smash your Spring House to pieces.

577
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,416
And if you keep spreading
gossip behind her back,

578
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,016
aren't you afraid His Majesty
will cut off your head?

579
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,256
-I...
-Come on, then!

580
00:32:58,280 --> 00:33:00,136
-Come on!
-Just you wait!

581
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,300
Let's go.

582
00:33:02,120 --> 00:33:03,896
How could Teacher say such a thing?

583
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,216
Father,

584
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,256
you weren't at court.

585
00:33:06,280 --> 00:33:07,656
The report must be mistaken.

586
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,860
Father,

587
00:33:09,560 --> 00:33:10,860
if you don't believe me,

588
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,420
then listen to A-Nian.

589
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:17,856
Sister Zhili,

590
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:19,216
I witnessed it with my
own eyes in the great hall.

591
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:21,656
The Right Chancellor indeed declared...

592
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:23,460
his support for abolishing
the Bureau of Intelligence

593
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,336
and severely punishing Lord Meng.

594
00:33:25,360 --> 00:33:27,736
Teacher has always supported
women taking the imperial examination

595
00:33:27,760 --> 00:33:29,856
and repeatedly spoke on Lord Meng's behalf.

596
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,536
Why would he suddenly change his position

597
00:33:31,560 --> 00:33:33,300
-and contradict his own actions?
-Sister,

598
00:33:33,560 --> 00:33:35,696
the Right Chancellor appears
upright and honorable,

599
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:37,056
but think carefully.

600
00:33:37,080 --> 00:33:39,016
Why have his actions in recent
years always pleased both sides?

601
00:33:39,040 --> 00:33:40,336
A-Nian,

602
00:33:40,360 --> 00:33:42,176
you only misunderstand Teacher

603
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:44,376
-because you don't truly know him.
-A-Nian,

604
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:45,336
go change your clothes

605
00:33:45,360 --> 00:33:46,820
and sit down to eat.

606
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,376
Father,

607
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:54,896
Teacher must have his
reasons for acting this way.

608
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:55,816
I'll go ask him myself.

609
00:33:55,840 --> 00:33:57,380
Stop.

610
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:03,016
I allowed you to study painting
under him back then

611
00:34:03,040 --> 00:34:05,980
because you loved the art
and had a natural gift.

612
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:09,736
Now that you are grown,

613
00:34:09,760 --> 00:34:11,576
you must remember even more clearly

614
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:14,376
that the bond between teacher
and student requires proper boundaries.

615
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:16,740
Your conduct must remain measured.

616
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:18,256
Father,

617
00:34:18,280 --> 00:34:19,896
I deeply respect Teacher.

618
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,336
That is why I do not want
others to misunderstand him.

619
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:23,060
Zhili,

620
00:34:26,720 --> 00:34:27,856
my child,

621
00:34:27,880 --> 00:34:28,896
within the court,

622
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:31,056
the human heart is an unfathomable abyss.

623
00:34:31,080 --> 00:34:33,656
Many matters are not simply black or white.

624
00:34:33,680 --> 00:34:36,576
Whether you question him
today and whether he answers

625
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:38,180
will make no difference.

626
00:34:38,600 --> 00:34:41,136
What you have seen is
merely the tip of the iceberg.

627
00:34:41,160 --> 00:34:43,656
Only by stepping outside the game

628
00:34:43,680 --> 00:34:46,220
can you glimpse the whole picture.

629
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:52,300
Come and eat.

630
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:09,860
Thank you, Father.

631
00:35:46,080 --> 00:35:47,536
Lord Meng,

632
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:48,900
please

633
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:50,780
accept all of these.

634
00:35:51,040 --> 00:35:52,456
Aren't these things

635
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,340
your usual favorites?

636
00:35:54,640 --> 00:35:56,096
I never knew

637
00:35:56,120 --> 00:35:58,020
you suffered so much as a child.

638
00:35:58,280 --> 00:35:59,576
I thought the matter with Jiang Mei'er

639
00:35:59,600 --> 00:36:01,256
had already caused you enough injustice.

640
00:36:01,280 --> 00:36:03,620
I never imagined Master Wen was so vicious.

641
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,656
You wandered from place
to place since childhood,

642
00:36:05,680 --> 00:36:07,696
yet still ranked first in
all three examinations.

643
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:09,700
I truly admire you beyond words.

644
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:13,860
I do not know how to express what I feel.

645
00:36:16,160 --> 00:36:17,900
I only hope these gifts

646
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:21,220
can bring some warmth
to your once-cold past.

647
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:28,740
Zhili,

648
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:31,140
why are your eyes turning red?

649
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:33,216
It is all in the past.

650
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:34,940
Everything ahead will be new.

651
00:36:50,160 --> 00:36:51,736
Lord Meng,

652
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:53,576
you were so young,

653
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:54,980
with no one to rely on,

654
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:57,340
yet you had to face

655
00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:00,176
the blades of human traffickers alone.

656
00:37:00,200 --> 00:37:02,420
How did you endure it?

657
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:05,340
If your family knew,

658
00:37:07,240 --> 00:37:08,540
their hearts would ache terribly.

659
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:10,540
For as long as I can remember,

660
00:37:12,440 --> 00:37:14,020
I wandered the streets.

661
00:37:14,720 --> 00:37:15,860
I became used to it.

662
00:37:16,560 --> 00:37:18,820
Simply surviving was already great fortune.

663
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:21,500
This is all my fault.

664
00:37:22,880 --> 00:37:24,780
Had I met you sooner,

665
00:37:25,880 --> 00:37:27,660
I would have risked my life

666
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:30,380
rather than let you
suffer in the slightest.

667
00:37:35,160 --> 00:37:36,816
After surviving a great calamity...

668
00:37:36,840 --> 00:37:38,260
-good fortune is sure to follow.
-Good fortune is sure to follow.

669
00:37:40,680 --> 00:37:42,056
Am I not perfectly well now?

670
00:37:42,080 --> 00:37:44,340
My lord, from this day forward,

671
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:46,140
on every road you must walk,

672
00:37:46,560 --> 00:37:47,456
I will go first.

673
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:48,980
Anyone you wish to kill,

674
00:37:49,520 --> 00:37:50,816
-I will strike first...
-Enough.

675
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:53,416
I know both of you mean well.

676
00:37:53,440 --> 00:37:56,456
Master Wen acted under
orders from the Tiger Roar Gang.

677
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:58,100
Ling Yunfei,

678
00:37:58,760 --> 00:38:00,416
after targeting me again and again,

679
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:02,456
will never stop here.

680
00:38:02,480 --> 00:38:03,696
We must act quickly.

681
00:38:03,720 --> 00:38:05,620
Ling Yunfei,

682
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:08,980
this time, we will settle

683
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:10,776
both old and new scores together.

684
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:13,136
Master Wen was remarkably tight-lipped.

685
00:38:13,160 --> 00:38:14,816
He admitted only that the
Tiger Roar Gang ordered him,

686
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:17,900
but refused to reveal their
stronghold no matter what.

687
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:20,456
Where exactly

688
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,736
is the Tiger Roar Gang's lair?

689
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:24,460
The Tiger Roar Gang is
not what it once was.

690
00:38:25,320 --> 00:38:27,180
It is no longer hidden so deeply.

691
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:30,460
I...

692
00:38:31,240 --> 00:38:32,616
have something to attend to today

693
00:38:32,640 --> 00:38:33,816
and must leave first.

694
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:35,500
-Where are you going?
-Where are you headed?

695
00:38:36,200 --> 00:38:37,900
To meet an old acquaintance.

696
00:39:01,600 --> 00:39:03,540
Your Majesty recognized me long ago.

697
00:39:03,880 --> 00:39:05,380
Why did you wait so long to say it?

698
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,180
I was wondering

699
00:39:08,080 --> 00:39:10,020
whether you had already forgotten me.

700
00:39:23,080 --> 00:39:25,100
You didn't draw this, did you?

701
00:39:25,560 --> 00:39:28,576
I thought that if one day

702
00:39:28,600 --> 00:39:30,820
I ever met that young man again,

703
00:39:31,720 --> 00:39:33,460
I would give it to him myself

704
00:39:35,240 --> 00:39:36,940
and thank him for saving me back then.

705
00:39:37,720 --> 00:39:39,540
So in your heart,

706
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:42,420
I was this handsome in those days.

707
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:50,860
Young man.

708
00:39:53,120 --> 00:39:54,260
He Du.

709
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:56,060
Your Majesty.

710
00:39:57,320 --> 00:39:59,820
Over these ten years,
under different identities,

711
00:40:00,080 --> 00:40:02,020
you have witnessed the course of my life.

712
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:21,580
Sister A-Xiang, hurry and eat.

713
00:40:38,920 --> 00:40:40,740
Thank you.

714
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:51,376
I was still young then
and handled matters poorly.

715
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:53,540
I failed to arrange a proper home for you.

716
00:40:54,080 --> 00:40:56,060
That was my fault.

717
00:40:58,520 --> 00:41:00,780
Your Majesty has already helped me greatly.

718
00:41:01,320 --> 00:41:02,816
I am doing very well now.

719
00:41:02,840 --> 00:41:04,260
You are doing well.

720
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:06,900
But I believe you can do even better.

721
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:09,580
I also believe you can
eradicate the Tiger Roar Gang

722
00:41:09,920 --> 00:41:11,380
and restore integrity to the court.

723
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:13,336
I also believe Your Majesty

724
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:15,180
is Great Ning's enlightened ruler

725
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:17,900
and will surely usher in
an age of prosperity.

726
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,580
Excellent wine.

727
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:38,656
As the ruler of a nation,

728
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:39,736
I am revered by all the people

729
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:41,416
and worshiped by every official.

730
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,496
They stand in awe of me,

731
00:41:42,520 --> 00:41:44,176
fear me, and scheme against me.

732
00:41:44,200 --> 00:41:45,620
Only you

733
00:41:46,680 --> 00:41:48,420
dare challenge me

734
00:41:49,160 --> 00:41:51,580
and also drink with me
and speak from the heart.

735
00:41:56,880 --> 00:41:58,296
You and I...

736
00:41:58,320 --> 00:41:59,900
Are we truly speaking from the heart?

737
00:42:01,520 --> 00:42:03,100
Are we not?
